{"id": "citywide-labor-agreement-bid-terms", "title": "What San Francisco and the building trades agreed to require of bidders", "seconds": 60.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "9e6a04adbb76735b", "words": 148, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City and construction unions entered their labor agreement in July 2020.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.77, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "could", "bid", "on", "covered", "projects?"], "sub": "Citywide labor agreement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.47, 0.59, 1.28, 1.78, 2.15, 2.35, 2.69, 3.21, 3.34, 3.73, 4.09]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "A qualified firm could bid even without a previous union contract.", "t0": 4.89, "t1": 8.85, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "signed", "kicker": "City and County of San Francisco and signatory labor organizations", "text": "Qualified bidders", "mark": "Qualified bidders"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.75, 1.11, 1.32, 1.63, 1.92, 2.27, 2.35, 2.87, 3.22]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "A nonexempt contractor had to agree to the project terms.", "t0": 8.97, "t1": 12.37, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Terms for covered work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.92, 1.62, 1.81, 1.91, 2.22, 2.32, 2.41, 2.88]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "Certified local firms could claim an exemption until covered payments exceeded five million dollars.", "t0": 12.49, "t1": 18.22, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5 million", "label": "Cumulative payments threshold for certified local firms"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.69, 1.05, 1.45, 1.64, 1.94, 2.03, 2.61, 2.9, 3.28, 3.79, 4.3, 4.66, 5.06]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The agreement provided for hiring halls and contained a no-strike commitment.", "t0": 18.34, "t1": 22.59, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "faq", "kicker": "San Francisco Office of Labor Standards Enforcement", "text": "Hiring provisions", "mark": "Hiring provisions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.57, 1.01, 1.2, 1.7, 2.21, 2.4, 2.86, 2.94, 3.58]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[3]"], "text": "Two contractors bid on the Mission Branch Library project.", "t0": 22.71, "t1": 26.29, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Mission Branch Library", "heading": "Two submitted prices", "source": "award", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Amoroso", "value": "$23,020,000"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "CLW Builders", "value": "$25,125,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 1.06, 1.32, 1.43, 1.53, 1.89, 2.33, 2.86]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[3]"], "text": "Amoroso ranked first on best value and received the contract.", "t0": 26.41, "t1": 30.21, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "award", "kicker": "San Francisco Public Works", "text": "Award record", "mark": "Award record"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.76, 1.1, 1.49, 1.67, 1.95, 2.44, 2.61, 3.02, 3.14]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "By December 2023 the City reported 288 assent letters and 49 exemption statements.", "t0": 30.43, "t1": 37.12, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "slides", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller and San Francisco Office of Labor Standards Enforcement", "text": "December 2023 presentation", "mark": "December 2023 presentation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.6, 0.9, 1.55, 1.67, 1.95, 2.39, 2.67, 3.05, 3.66, 4.09, 4.55, 4.79, 5.36, 5.94]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "Four businesses crossed the exemption threshold that year.", "t0": 37.24, "t1": 40.56, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Threshold crossed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 1.05, 1.44, 1.56, 2.15, 2.71, 2.94]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "The presentation listed 23 awarded projects and reported no work stoppages.", "t0": 40.68, "t1": 45.73, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "23", "label": "Awarded projects in the presentation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.89, 1.24, 1.89, 2.32, 2.98, 3.19, 3.69, 3.91, 4.2]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "No covered project had been completed by the June 2023 evaluation cutoff.", "t0": 45.85, "t1": 50.78, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller", "text": "Evaluation cutoff", "mark": "Evaluation cutoff"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.68, 1.23, 1.35, 1.53, 2.05, 2.2, 2.33, 2.67, 3.02, 3.59, 4.33]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "Those records cannot isolate the agreement's effect on construction costs or bidder turnout.", "t0": 50.9, "t1": 56.49, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Effect on bids", "Effect on costs"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.8, 1.24, 1.74, 1.85, 2.38, 2.81, 2.97, 3.65, 4.16, 4.39, 4.73]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 56.61, "t1": 59.22, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Bidding for covered work", "evidence": "What the City measured"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}